/// Row contract produced by the compiled Prometheus range-query adapter.
module sattle.source.prometheus @ 1.0.0;

/// One sample of one series. `series` is the label set that tells the series of a metric apart; `instance` is its `instance` label, absent when the query aggregates it away.
rows MetricRow { time: Instant; cluster: Text; metric: Text; series: Text; instance?: Text; value: Decimal; }
